ro":[["Kebab pizza is a Swedish style of pizza topped with kebab meat and other ingredients, the precise topping often varying between restaurants. The kebab pizza was created by Middle Eastern immigrants in the 1980s. Since its creation, the kebab pizza has increased in popularity and is today one of Sweden's most popular pizzas, and one of the most popular fast food dishes overall. Due to its popularity the dish has reached a position of cultural prominence in Sweden as well as all over Scandinavia, sometimes being invoked in popular culture and politics."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-kebab-pizza"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kebab_pizza"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Swedish cuisine","cuisine/swedish-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":1,"links":[["Kebab","ingredient/kebab"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Scandicuisine: Swedish recipes","ref":"site/scandicuisine-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"scandicuisine.com","note":"Traditional Swedish recipes from Cecilia, a cook from a Finnish-Swedish family on Åland.","url":"https://scandicuisine.com/category/swedish-recipes","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Swedish cuisine","links":[["Biff à la Lindström","dish/biff-a-la-lindstrom"],["Blåbärssoppa","dish/blabarssoppa"],["Blodpalt","dish/blodpalt"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Flying Jacob","dish/flying-jacob"],["Fruktsoppa","dish/fruktsoppa"],["Glögg","dish/glogg"],["Hasselback potatoes","dish/hasselback-potatoes"],["Isterband","dish/isterband"],["Korv stroganoff","dish/korv-stroganoff"],["Kroppkaka","dish/kroppkaka"],["Limpa","dish/limpa"],["Lutefisk","dish/lutefisk"],["Oatmeal ball","dish/oatmeal-ball"],["Ostkaka","dish/ostkaka"],["Rødgrød","dish/r-dgr-d"],["Semla","dish/semla"],["Smörgåstårta","dish/smorgastarta"],["Strong beer","dish/strong-beer"],["Surströmming","dish/surstromming"],["Swedish meatballs","dish/swedish-meatballs"]]}]},"dish/naan":{"t":"dish","r":"di